{"_id":"6901de24166b018f83dfdbc9","roadmapSlug":"shell-bash","nodeId":"EqgAG1t05RuiAO1TXRq4Y","description":"# Bash\n\nBash, short for Bourne Again Shell, is a command-line interpreter and a shell scripting language. It's a program that allows users to interact with the operating system by typing commands. Bash interprets these commands and instructs the operating system to perform specific actions, making it a fundamental tool for system administration, automation, and software development.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bash_(Unix_shell)#:~:text=Bash (short for \"Bourne Again,Chet Ramey)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bash_(Unix_shell)#:~:text=Bash%20(short%20for%20%22Bourne%20Again,Chet%20Ramey)","_id":"6a7f4b52cb44947debcff034"},{"type":"article","title":"Bash Tutorial","url":"https://www.w3schools.com/bash/","_id":"6a7f4b52cb44947debcff035"},{"type":"video","title":"Bash Scripting Full Course 3 Hours","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e7BufAVwDiM","_id":"6a7f4b52cb44947debcff036"},{"type":"video","title":"Bash Scripting Tutorial for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tK9Oc6AEnR4","_id":"6a7f4b52cb44947debcff037"}],"createdAt":"2025-10-29T09:28:04.012Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:07:30.660Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/shell-bash/content/EqgAG1t05RuiAO1TXRq4Y.md"}